        ],
        "text": "The petitioner argues that when the Court construes a statute, it must consider the statutory language, the purpose of the statute, and the results produced by the construction."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "20bcb13ee8d83269368ea9ab9f5d24cae285bf2b6ebb8bb3a40a780dbccefe1c",
